VVER-440/179|number_of_control_elements|CONFIRMED||HIGH|VVER-Type Reactors of Russian Design (Springer) / VVER design-evolution search synthesis: "the original design of VVER-440 type reactors had 73 mechanical control rods" (V-179 first generation)
